(5297106, 770875, 99218, '<td valign="top">nice! i like it!</td>', 'nice! i like it!', '2009-03-09 08:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297107, 770993, 99218, '<td valign="top">i like this one!</td>', 'i like this one!', '2009-03-09 08:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297108, 771583, 99218, '<td valign="top">cool! nice shot!</td>', 'cool! nice shot!', '2009-03-09 08:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297109, 771609, 99218, '<td valign="top">cool! nice shot!</td>', 'cool! nice shot!', '2009-03-09 08:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297118, 770568, 101117, '<td valign="top">The shot is clear and in good focus and the subject is quite obviously the subject, but very much in the way you would document something, rather than make a good photo if you see what I mean. There is nothing particularly outstanding about this shot and I have no real reaction to it.</td>', 'The shot is clear and in good focus and the subject is quite obviously the subject, but very much in the way you would document something, rather than make a good photo if you see what I mean. There is nothing particularly outstanding about this shot and I have no real reaction to it.', '2009-03-09 08:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297119, 771601, 101117, '<td valign="top">I can see the effect you are going for here, but it looks way over processed to the point where it appears you have superimposed one shot on top of the other. I also don''t think the colours work well for the idea (which I assume is haunted / mystery), perhaps if the background building was toned down a little and the foreground building more grey it would work.</td>', 'I can see the effect you are going for here, but it looks way over processed to the point where it appears you have superimposed one shot on top of the other. I also don''t think the colours work well for the idea (which I assume is haunted / mystery), perhaps if the background building was toned down a little and the foreground building more grey it would work.', '2009-03-09 08:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297123, 771452, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a nice scene but I think you''ve tried to fit too much in here. I''m guessing the structure is the main subject, and only because of the theme of the challenge. Otherwise I would tend to look towards the path leading out of the right of the frame. The trees seem to cut a diagonal line right across the shot, but don''t actually lead anywhere, and the structure is more of an incidental than a subject.</td>', 'This is a nice scene but I think you''ve tried to fit too much in here. I''m guessing the structure is the main subject, and only because of the theme of the challenge. Otherwise I would tend to look towards the path leading out of the right of the frame. The trees seem to cut a diagonal line right across the shot, but don''t actually lead anywhere, and the structure is more of an incidental than a subject.', '2009-03-09 08:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297124, 770690, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is quite an interesting shot from the perspective of the subject, but let down slightly by the composition. I don''t think the all black background helps here, I think an old desk or perhaps stone would have worked much better given the subject, as it is the blackness actually draws my attention to the edges because of the strong contrast.<br/> <br/>Also, I don''t like the way part of this is out the frame, it''s such an interesting subject it would have been good to have it fully in the shot.</td>', 'This is quite an interesting shot from the perspective of the subject, but let down slightly by the composition. I don''t think the all black background helps here, I think an old desk or perhaps stone would have worked much better given the subject, as it is the blackness actually draws my attention to the edges because of the strong contrast. Also, I don''t like the way part of this is out the frame, it''s such an interesting subject it would have been good to have it fully in the shot.', '2009-03-09 08:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297127, 771524, 101117, '<td valign="top">The black and white toning here feels a little flat and my attention is drawn more to the sky than the building. Some more contrast or some burning on the building could have helped.</td>', 'The black and white toning here feels a little flat and my attention is drawn more to the sky than the building. Some more contrast or some burning on the building could have helped.', '2009-03-09 08:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297134, 770779, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot taken in a nice light. I wouldn''t have actually known what I was looking at here if it hadn''t been for the title and my initial thought was that the flag definitely doesn''t look 100 years old! <br/> <br/>I like both the people on the street and the building next door which adds a bit of contrast to the shot, but I don''t like the corner of the building you have managed to catch on the left hand side of the frame, it could have been a better shot if you had changed the angle a little or got a bit closer and used a wider lens (if available). Still, giving this a 7 because of the good composition and like I said, I really like the light.</td>', 'This is a good shot taken in a nice light. I wouldn''t have actually known what I was looking at here if it hadn''t been for the title and my initial thought was that the flag definitely doesn''t look 100 years old!  I like both the people on the street and the building next door which adds a bit of contrast to the shot, but I don''t like the corner of the building you have managed to catch on the left hand side of the frame, it could have been a better shot if you had changed the angle a little or got a bit closer and used a wider lens (if available). Still, giving this a 7 because of the good composition and like I said, I really like the light.', '2009-03-09 08:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297138, 771571, 101117, '<td valign="top">This type of shot is unfortunately overdone and you''ve not really added anything special here which makes this particular one stand out.<br/> <br/>Taken on it''s own, it''s a nice shot, well composed, feels like you are standing half way up (I don''t know this building, just the impression I''m getting) and a wider more dramatic feel would have helped.<br/> <br/>The lighting is good and even, though not always what you want in a setting like this. Some dramatic shadows help give this sort of architecture a bit of character.</td>', 'This type of shot is unfortunately overdone and you''ve not really added anything special here which makes this particular one stand out. Taken on it''s own, it''s a nice shot, well composed, feels like you are standing half way up (I don''t know this building, just the impression I''m getting) and a wider more dramatic feel would have helped. The lighting is good and even, though not always what you want in a setting like this. Some dramatic shadows help give this sort of architecture a bit of character.', '2009-03-09 08:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297144, 771549, 101117, '<td valign="top">There are a few things that immediately strike me as wrong with this shot. The closest headstone, which I''m thinking is the main subject here, is too centred, which has left the ones running out of the right side pretty much drawing a line across the middle of the frame. This in turn has left quite a bit of background on the left side with the headstones there again running out of the middle of the frame, almost giving you a sort of centred horizon.<br/> <br/>I think if you had kept the angle you are viewing this at, but moved a little to the right (placing the main subject in the left third) this would have given the shot more depth and a better composition in general.</td>', 'There are a few things that immediately strike me as wrong with this shot. The closest headstone, which I''m thinking is the main subject here, is too centred, which has left the ones running out of the right side pretty much drawing a line across the middle of the frame. This in turn has left quite a bit of background on the left side with the headstones there again running out of the middle of the frame, almost giving you a sort of centred horizon. I think if you had kept the angle you are viewing this at, but moved a little to the right (placing the main subject in the left third) this would have given the shot more depth and a better composition in general.', '2009-03-09 08:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297148, 769987, 101117, '<td valign="top">It took me a few seconds to notice the figure walking through the middle of the frame for some reason. Initially I just thought it was a shot of the interior of an old building with a table and green chair in the foreground (I know that''s what it is but I''m just describing my initial reaction to it).<br/> <br/>While what you''ve done is amusing, it''s not made for a great photo, especially given that the figure is wearing denims and a white top. Perhaps a girl in a dress would have worked better and a darker atmosphere.<br/> <br/>I''m actually giving a 4 for this because of the figure, otherwise as a photo I would have given it a 5.</td>', 'It took me a few seconds to notice the figure walking through the middle of the frame for some reason. Initially I just thought it was a shot of the interior of an old building with a table and green chair in the foreground (I know that''s what it is but I''m just describing my initial reaction to it). While what you''ve done is amusing, it''s not made for a great photo, especially given that the figure is wearing denims and a white top. Perhaps a girl in a dress would have worked better and a darker atmosphere. I''m actually giving a 4 for this because of the figure, otherwise as a photo I would have given it a 5.', '2009-03-09 08:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297150, 771051, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a nice reproduction of an old style scene, though I''m not sure technically if it meets the challenge, and while I definitely won''t mark you down for that as I like what you''ve done, I''m sure others will.<br/> <br/>Everything you have here works well, and it does feel quite authentic (apart from the sharp clear photo). The lighting is good and the details are clear, I''m not sure about the glass on the table though, feels like it''s been forced into the shot as it''s sitting right on the edge. If you really wanted to include the glass you could have pulled the table into the frame a little more.</td>', 'This is a nice reproduction of an old style scene, though I''m not sure technically if it meets the challenge, and while I definitely won''t mark you down for that as I like what you''ve done, I''m sure others will. Everything you have here works well, and it does feel quite authentic (apart from the sharp clear photo). The lighting is good and the details are clear, I''m not sure about the glass on the table though, feels like it''s been forced into the shot as it''s sitting right on the edge. If you really wanted to include the glass you could have pulled the table into the frame a little more.', '2009-03-09 09:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297151, 771632, 74663, '<td valign="top">or maybe 4.5 Billion years.  You know - give or take.</td>', 'or maybe 4.5 Billion years.  You know - give or take.', '2009-03-09 09:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297153, 770671, 101117, '<td valign="top">While I''m sure this is a very old cactus, I''m afraid it doesn''t make for a particularly interesting photo. Shot also feels a little grainy, like it was taken on a cell phone camera or something.</td>', 'While I''m sure this is a very old cactus, I''m afraid it doesn''t make for a particularly interesting photo. Shot also feels a little grainy, like it was taken on a cell phone camera or something.', '2009-03-09 09:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297158, 770993, 101117, '<td valign="top">I feel like this scene has so much potential yet you have somehow missed out on a great photo here. There''s something about the composition which isn''t quite working, perhaps it all feels a little linear and front on, maybe a change of angle would have helped, perhaps more from the left to take in a bit more of the window, and closer to the table to see some of the detail in those old tools.<br/> <br/>Also, there''s something on the wall just at the top of the shot which it looks like you''ve been trying to avoid, I would have cropped that off altogether or included it if it was interesting.</td>', 'I feel like this scene has so much potential yet you have somehow missed out on a great photo here. There''s something about the composition which isn''t quite working, perhaps it all feels a little linear and front on, maybe a change of angle would have helped, perhaps more from the left to take in a bit more of the window, and closer to the table to see some of the detail in those old tools. Also, there''s something on the wall just at the top of the shot which it looks like you''ve been trying to avoid, I would have cropped that off altogether or included it if it was interesting.', '2009-03-09 09:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297161, 770185, 101117, '<td valign="top">I see where you''re going with this, but as you have pointed out yourself, it''s only half way there. I do like the shot, I think it''s a really interesting composition and good use of B&amp;W but I feel obliged to knock some points off for not meeting the challenge. 4.</td>', 'I see where you''re going with this, but as you have pointed out yourself, it''s only half way there. I do like the shot, I think it''s a really interesting composition and good use of B&W but I feel obliged to knock some points off for not meeting the challenge. 4.', '2009-03-09 09:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297163, 771108, 101117, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been quite a nice shot, but you seem to have WAY over sharpened it. The mountain in the background looks completely fake and the whole photo looks like it has been blown up from a thumbnail image. Did you crop this from a much larger shot or something?</td>', 'I think this could have been quite a nice shot, but you seem to have WAY over sharpened it. The mountain in the background looks completely fake and the whole photo looks like it has been blown up from a thumbnail image. Did you crop this from a much larger shot or something?', '2009-03-09 09:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297167, 770904, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is quite a nice shot, I like the colours here. Unfortunately your focus seems a little off which is detracting slightly from an otherwise good shot.</td>', 'This is quite a nice shot, I like the colours here. Unfortunately your focus seems a little off which is detracting slightly from an otherwise good shot.', '2009-03-09 09:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297168, 770867, 88492, '<td valign="top">Is this a picture of an old postcard or stamp?</td>', 'Is this a picture of an old postcard or stamp?', '2009-03-09 09:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297175, 771497, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is quite a nice serene shot, with good exposure and lighting. Unfortunately I feel it is a little busy, possibly because the foreground and background colours are quite close to each other, the main subject doesn''t particularly stand out at all.</td>', 'This is quite a nice serene shot, with good exposure and lighting. Unfortunately I feel it is a little busy, possibly because the foreground and background colours are quite close to each other, the main subject doesn''t particularly stand out at all.', '2009-03-09 09:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297177, 771254, 101117, '<td valign="top">The building has a nice contrast against the (slightly unusual shade of) blue sky. I do think it would have been nicer if you could have included the whole front of the building though. From this I have no idea just how high you are looking at the building, whether that is the top of a doorway at the bottom of the frame or just an arch in the decoration. Also might have been worthwhile perspective correcting it, even if only a bit.</td>', 'The building has a nice contrast against the (slightly unusual shade of) blue sky. I do think it would have been nicer if you could have included the whole front of the building though. From this I have no idea just how high you are looking at the building, whether that is the top of a doorway at the bottom of the frame or just an arch in the decoration. Also might have been worthwhile perspective correcting it, even if only a bit.', '2009-03-09 09:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297180, 771400, 88492, '<td valign="top">Looks like my dad''s garage in the Shetland Islands.</td>', 'Looks like my dad''s garage in the Shetland Islands.', '2009-03-09 09:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297183, 770938, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, though I think it would have been nicer if you had included the whole building. Mind you, I don''t know what the rest of the building looks like so I may be wrong, but that''s just the impression I get when I look at this.</td>', 'Nice shot, though I think it would have been nicer if you had included the whole building. Mind you, I don''t know what the rest of the building looks like so I may be wrong, but that''s just the impression I get when I look at this.', '2009-03-09 09:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297188, 771172, 92577, '<td valign="top">this view has quickly become a modern classic. I like your crop and B/W treatment. good luck</td>', 'this view has quickly become a modern classic. I like your crop and B/W treatment. good luck', '2009-03-09 09:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297189, 771626, 101117, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen a shot of this building before, though looking down at it rather than up. This is also a nice perspective and I like the fact you can see street detail as well as some motion in the cars. Gives it a real city like feel! 7.</td>', 'I''ve seen a shot of this building before, though looking down at it rather than up. This is also a nice perspective and I like the fact you can see street detail as well as some motion in the cars. Gives it a real city like feel! 7.', '2009-03-09 09:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297191, 771585, 92577, '<td valign="top">pleasing</td>', 'pleasing', '2009-03-09 09:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297193, 769959, 101117, '<td valign="top">This like a lot of other shots in this challenge feels very much like it is just documenting the object rather than making a good photo out of it. I think what has caused that here is the background. Also, what I can only assume is a cushion to the left is just in the way.</td>', 'This like a lot of other shots in this challenge feels very much like it is just documenting the object rather than making a good photo out of it. I think what has caused that here is the background. Also, what I can only assume is a cushion to the left is just in the way.', '2009-03-09 09:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297198, 771005, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot, one of the better ones I''ve seen so far. Good use of B&amp;W, though sometimes I think these old buildings can have wonderful colour too. Nice angle as well.<br/> <br/>Don''t like the sky though, it''s ended up looking quite dark and threatening, which is in contrast to the brightly lit building with shadows. I think whatever colour filter you have used has been the cause of that.</td>', 'This is a good shot, one of the better ones I''ve seen so far. Good use of B&W, though sometimes I think these old buildings can have wonderful colour too. Nice angle as well. Don''t like the sky though, it''s ended up looking quite dark and threatening, which is in contrast to the brightly lit building with shadows. I think whatever colour filter you have used has been the cause of that.', '2009-03-09 09:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297200, 771238, 33515, '<td valign="top">Funny enough I was thinking about driving up and photographing this for the challenge as well. Nice image and perspective, you may have been better served in using the full in size and file size. Hope it''s doing well for you.</td>', 'Funny enough I was thinking about driving up and photographing this for the challenge as well. Nice image and perspective, you may have been better served in using the full in size and file size. Hope it''s doing well for you.', '2009-03-09 09:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297201, 771148, 92577, '<td valign="top">pleasing colours and composition but somehow it''s not quite sharp enough. (Also it''s tilting down to the right) good luck</td>', 'pleasing colours and composition but somehow it''s not quite sharp enough. (Also it''s tilting down to the right) good luck', '2009-03-09 09:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297202, 771376, 101117, '<td valign="top">These certainly are old indeed, but it does feel like you have just taken the shot to document them, as though to place in a catalogue to be archived somewhere. Perhaps a much closer shot of just a single one to see some of the detail in the old rusted metal would have been better.</td>', 'These certainly are old indeed, but it does feel like you have just taken the shot to document them, as though to place in a catalogue to be archived somewhere. Perhaps a much closer shot of just a single one to see some of the detail in the old rusted metal would have been better.', '2009-03-09 09:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297209, 771538, 88492, '<td valign="top">nice shadow, makes it more interesting.</td>', 'nice shadow, makes it more interesting.', '2009-03-09 09:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297212, 771538, 101117, '<td valign="top">You have managed to avoid what a lot of the other shots in this challenge have suffered from and that is ending up with a photo which simply documents the item. You have a great use of shadow and lighting here, which compliment what is already an interesting (and unusual) object. I don''t know what this is, but I can only assume it''s part of some light experiment. 8 from me.</td>', 'You have managed to avoid what a lot of the other shots in this challenge have suffered from and that is ending up with a photo which simply documents the item. You have a great use of shadow and lighting here, which compliment what is already an interesting (and unusual) object. I don''t know what this is, but I can only assume it''s part of some light experiment. 8 from me.', '2009-03-09 09:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297213, 770891, 88492, '<td valign="top">sorry, too overworked and ''fluffy'' for me 4</td>', 'sorry, too overworked and ''fluffy'' for me 4', '2009-03-09 09:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297215, 771556, 92577, '<td valign="top">cool location. Going B/W has almost camoflaged the buiding!</td>', 'cool location. Going B/W has almost camoflaged the buiding!', '2009-03-09 09:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297218, 771602, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot all round with some good colours as well. It does have an HDRish feel to it, which usually makes me dislike a photo on first sight, but I think you have handled it well here, apart from the clouds to the top right which I feel are a little overdone and harsh compared to the soft tones of the rest of the image.<br/> <br/>I would also like to see a wide angle shot which brings in that wall to the left as well some more, but as it stands I really like this one. 7, and that''s only because of the clouds or I would have scored it higher.</td>', 'This is a great shot all round with some good colours as well. It does have an HDRish feel to it, which usually makes me dislike a photo on first sight, but I think you have handled it well here, apart from the clouds to the top right which I feel are a little overdone and harsh compared to the soft tones of the rest of the image. I would also like to see a wide angle shot which brings in that wall to the left as well some more, but as it stands I really like this one. 7, and that''s only because of the clouds or I would have scored it higher.', '2009-03-09 09:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297222, 770891, 101117, '<td valign="top">Stonehenge is always an interesting subject to photo, but you''ve done something weird here, possibly over sharpening which has caused a halo around the stones and removed them from the rest of the image. That large white cloud formation also looks a bit odd against an otherwise very overcast sky.</td>', 'Stonehenge is always an interesting subject to photo, but you''ve done something weird here, possibly over sharpening which has caused a halo around the stones and removed them from the rest of the image. That large white cloud formation also looks a bit odd against an otherwise very overcast sky.', '2009-03-09 09:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297223, 771609, 92577, '<td valign="top">has a very nice feel to it. (looks a bit tilted, but with an old building you never know)</td>', 'has a very nice feel to it. (looks a bit tilted, but with an old building you never know)', '2009-03-09 09:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297224, 771566, 88492, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this is so over processed, it looks like it has been cut out with scissors from a print.</td>', 'Sorry, this is so over processed, it looks like it has been cut out with scissors from a print.', '2009-03-09 09:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297226, 769801, 88492, '<td valign="top">That border is too much, it detracts from the image and dominates the frame</td>', 'That border is too much, it detracts from the image and dominates the frame', '2009-03-09 09:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297227, 771589, 92577, '<td valign="top">nice - makes me want to look all around it!</td>', 'nice - makes me want to look all around it!', '2009-03-09 09:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297228, 771227, 101117, '<td valign="top">The bridge does look like an interesting subject, but I don''t think this is the best angle to take it from. The trees are just in the way and add nothing to the shot, and you''ve only managed to capture part of the bridge. I think this would be best taken from down at the water level looking up at the bridge, though I see a metal fence there, so I"m guessing they don''t really want you going down there.</td>', 'The bridge does look like an interesting subject, but I don''t think this is the best angle to take it from. The trees are just in the way and add nothing to the shot, and you''ve only managed to capture part of the bridge. I think this would be best taken from down at the water level looking up at the bridge, though I see a metal fence there, so I"m guessing they don''t really want you going down there.', '2009-03-09 09:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297231, 771515, 43774, '<td valign="top">An old house with fantastic trees. But there''s something really weird in the sky above the first tree.....almost like text?</td>', 'An old house with fantastic trees. But there''s something really weird in the sky above the first tree.....almost like text?', '2009-03-09 09:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297235, 770867, 101117, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing from the edges you have a photo of a photo here (or possibly a stamp in which case you''re probably going to get DQ''d.<br/> <br/>Judging the photo alone (as it''s not my job to judge DQ''s), it''s initially too small, it''s also a touch blurry, though that could be down to the small size, and I''m not really sure what the subject is. The colours are a bit flat and you have a weird angle thing going on there.</td>', 'I''m guessing from the edges you have a photo of a photo here (or possibly a stamp in which case you''re probably going to get DQ''d. Judging the photo alone (as it''s not my job to judge DQ''s), it''s initially too small, it''s also a touch blurry, though that could be down to the small size, and I''m not really sure what the subject is. The colours are a bit flat and you have a weird angle thing going on there.', '2009-03-09 09:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297243, 771547, 92577, '<td valign="top">very nice - I''d like to know the story behind it...?</td>', 'very nice - I''d like to know the story behind it...?', '2009-03-09 09:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297249, 771653, 56978, '<td valign="top">good capture...shame about the slight fringeing lower-left but nice and sharp (I know how tough it is to get these kind of images even with a telescope!).  Not sure how the DPCers will go with the concept though.</td>', 'good capture...shame about the slight fringeing lower-left but nice and sharp (I know how tough it is to get these kind of images even with a telescope!).  Not sure how the DPCers will go with the concept though.', '2009-03-09 09:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297254, 771466, 56978, '<td valign="top">mmm, love the ultra-goth feel to this....must be the blood-red border complementing the mouldy green tones...nice one!</td>', 'mmm, love the ultra-goth feel to this....must be the blood-red border complementing the mouldy green tones...nice one!', '2009-03-09 09:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5297255, 771632, 36981, '<td valign="top">Decent image of the moon - I love the details you got.  I assume the title is a joke?  Or an attempt at controversy.  I can''t decide whether to include the title in my vote.  It seems that you want me to ...</td>', 'Decent image of the moon - I love the details you got.  I assume the title is a joke?  Or an attempt at controversy.  I can''t decide whether to include the title in my vote.  It seems that you want me to ...', '2009-03-09 09:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
