(5298049, 771459, 43774, '<td valign="top">A lovely scene, great light and colour.</td>', 'A lovely scene, great light and colour.', '2009-03-09 18:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298052, 770875, 43774, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous building! Good perspective.</td>', 'What a gorgeous building! Good perspective.', '2009-03-09 18:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298058, 771637, 43774, '<td valign="top">Is this the National Cathedral in Washington DC? I really like your processing, good colour and a nice sky as well.</td>', 'Is this the National Cathedral in Washington DC? I really like your processing, good colour and a nice sky as well.', '2009-03-09 18:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298081, 771549, 31637, '<td valign="top">Too dark, try using levels or maybe some dodging.</td>', 'Too dark, try using levels or maybe some dodging.', '2009-03-09 18:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298082, 771602, 31637, '<td valign="top">Great composition</td>', 'Great composition', '2009-03-09 18:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298087, 770696, 31637, '<td valign="top">Nice dress and locale, not sure the sharpness is what it could be.</td>', 'Nice dress and locale, not sure the sharpness is what it could be.', '2009-03-09 18:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298089, 771233, 31637, '<td valign="top">Great colors, what a composition too!</td>', 'Great colors, what a composition too!', '2009-03-09 18:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298094, 771397, 31637, '<td valign="top">Overexposed sky hurts this a bit, nice find though, amazing place.</td>', 'Overexposed sky hurts this a bit, nice find though, amazing place.', '2009-03-09 18:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298101, 770779, 31637, '<td valign="top">Cool shot of the NYSE, wonder what they were protesting, the civilians scattered around add to this, the flag on the building makes it look less antique I think.</td>', 'Cool shot of the NYSE, wonder what they were protesting, the civilians scattered around add to this, the flag on the building makes it look less antique I think.', '2009-03-09 18:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298105, 771529, 31637, '<td valign="top">Those cavemen must have met plenty of odd worldly creatures in those days...</td>', 'Those cavemen must have met plenty of odd worldly creatures in those days...', '2009-03-09 18:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298149, 771466, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is spooky in a wonderful sort of way.  I would give this a 10, except for the honking border.  So, 9 instead.  Still, it''s a fascinating image that I thought of a couple of times today at random moments.  Kudos for impact!  :)</td>', 'This is spooky in a wonderful sort of way.  I would give this a 10, except for the honking border.  So, 9 instead.  Still, it''s a fascinating image that I thought of a couple of times today at random moments.  Kudos for impact!  :)', '2009-03-09 19:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298152, 771589, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is really quite a fancy car, eh?  So nice that you captured the beauty of it exquisitely.  Keep up the good work!</td>', 'This is really quite a fancy car, eh?  So nice that you captured the beauty of it exquisitely.  Keep up the good work!', '2009-03-09 19:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298154, 771430, 29009, '<td valign="top">Amazing amount of detail, and nice leading lines into the frame.  I wish the sky were a bit more dramatic, but this is essentially an excellent shot.</td>', 'Amazing amount of detail, and nice leading lines into the frame.  I wish the sky were a bit more dramatic, but this is essentially an excellent shot.', '2009-03-09 19:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298155, 771602, 29009, '<td valign="top">Ha ha, I saw this before I think.  :)  Still, I remain impressed.  This was your challenge idea, wasn''t it?  Good luck!</td>', 'Ha ha, I saw this before I think.  :)  Still, I remain impressed.  This was your challenge idea, wasn''t it?  Good luck!', '2009-03-09 19:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298157, 770869, 31637, '<td valign="top">damn fence... nice find otherwise</td>', 'damn fence... nice find otherwise', '2009-03-09 19:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298159, 769987, 39880, '<td valign="top">I know where this is.  Did you do the ghost tour?  As for the shot, nice exposure.  Looks good.</td>', 'I know where this is.  Did you do the ghost tour?  As for the shot, nice exposure.  Looks good.', '2009-03-09 19:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298160, 771547, 29009, '<td valign="top">This one just kind of blew my socks off - it''s worthy of a giant canvas print on the wall!  Super super nice.</td>', 'This one just kind of blew my socks off - it''s worthy of a giant canvas print on the wall!  Super super nice.', '2009-03-09 19:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298161, 771005, 59029, '<td valign="top">cool old wood schoolhouse.  Any idea how old it is?  Mine''s redbrick from 1879, but before that was wooden too. nice comp and light. 8</td>', 'cool old wood schoolhouse.  Any idea how old it is?  Mine''s redbrick from 1879, but before that was wooden too. nice comp and light. 8', '2009-03-09 19:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298165, 769987, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is really a beautiful interior.  I would have scored this much higher if the "ghosts" had been in period costume.  Something seems anachronistic about the modern clothes.</td>', 'This is really a beautiful interior.  I would have scored this much higher if the "ghosts" had been in period costume.  Something seems anachronistic about the modern clothes.', '2009-03-09 19:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298229, 770608, 92108, '<td valign="top">Would be a lot better if the object on the left was not in the photo, plus the photo is not level.</td>', 'Would be a lot better if the object on the left was not in the photo, plus the photo is not level.', '2009-03-09 20:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298234, 771320, 92108, '<td valign="top">Good one, lighting in the windows makes the shot.  I like everything about the old castles and you caught this one just right.</td>', 'Good one, lighting in the windows makes the shot.  I like everything about the old castles and you caught this one just right.', '2009-03-09 20:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298237, 771399, 92108, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is awesome.  Great shot!!!</td>', 'Wow, this is awesome.  Great shot!!!', '2009-03-09 20:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298238, 771046, 92108, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good highlights and color.</td>', 'Nice shot, good highlights and color.', '2009-03-09 20:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298239, 771289, 92108, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but it''s just too dark.</td>', 'Good composition, but it''s just too dark.', '2009-03-09 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298247, 771602, 92108, '<td valign="top">Nice layout.  You got the essence of the place, good composition. the only improvement would be to brighten the color a little.</td>', 'Nice layout.  You got the essence of the place, good composition. the only improvement would be to brighten the color a little.', '2009-03-09 20:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298250, 771213, 92108, '<td valign="top">You did good, this is a real nice shot.</td>', 'You did good, this is a real nice shot.', '2009-03-09 20:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298253, 771474, 92108, '<td valign="top">Not in focus, otherwise a good shot.</td>', 'Not in focus, otherwise a good shot.', '2009-03-09 20:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298255, 770556, 92108, '<td valign="top">It''s just too out of focus for me.</td>', 'It''s just too out of focus for me.', '2009-03-09 20:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298258, 770300, 92108, '<td valign="top">Really nice, caught it just right!!</td>', 'Really nice, caught it just right!!', '2009-03-09 20:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298266, 771296, 98771, '<td valign="top">I like this, simple yet elegant.</td>', 'I like this, simple yet elegant.', '2009-03-09 21:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298271, 770992, 98771, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic, I like it.</td>', 'Very dramatic, I like it.', '2009-03-09 21:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298275, 771508, 327, '<td valign="top">Hey neat idea for the challenge however the shot is not in focus. Try putting the camera on a table, stool, shelf, if you don''t have a tripod. Lovely old clock.</td>', 'Hey neat idea for the challenge however the shot is not in focus. Try putting the camera on a table, stool, shelf, if you don''t have a tripod. Lovely old clock.', '2009-03-09 21:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298277, 771111, 98771, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, take the power lines out of it, and could have been taken a hundred years ago.</td>', 'Nice shot, take the power lines out of it, and could have been taken a hundred years ago.', '2009-03-09 21:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298278, 771084, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very complimentary colors, beautiful coin.  I would have cropped it a little tighter on the right, and used a smoother surface :-)</td>', 'Very complimentary colors, beautiful coin.  I would have cropped it a little tighter on the right, and used a smoother surface :-)', '2009-03-09 21:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298279, 769959, 96751, '<td valign="top">A tough subject.  The shiny surface is challenging enough, but the background with the tufted surface and the lace pillow are very distracting from the lovely doll.</td>', 'A tough subject.  The shiny surface is challenging enough, but the background with the tufted surface and the lace pillow are very distracting from the lovely doll.', '2009-03-09 21:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298281, 771516, 327, '<td valign="top">gosh I haven''t seen that in over 30 years! As a kid my dad used to take me fishing near there and also the Barnegat Lighthouse. Flounder! Fun for me to see this place and you captured it from the perfet view. Nice one.</td>', 'gosh I haven''t seen that in over 30 years! As a kid my dad used to take me fishing near there and also the Barnegat Lighthouse. Flounder! Fun for me to see this place and you captured it from the perfet view. Nice one.', '2009-03-09 21:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298283, 771547, 327, '<td valign="top">Just perfect.</td>', 'Just perfect.', '2009-03-09 21:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298284, 771593, 96751, '<td valign="top">I find this oddly appealing.  It kind of grew on me.  I think it''s the perspective and the colorful houses.  The yucky slush is offputting, though the straight lines add great perspective.  I especially like the footprints in the otherwise still scene, but the lighting is a bit flat.</td>', 'I find this oddly appealing.  It kind of grew on me.  I think it''s the perspective and the colorful houses.  The yucky slush is offputting, though the straight lines add great perspective.  I especially like the footprints in the otherwise still scene, but the lighting is a bit flat.', '2009-03-09 21:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298285, 771051, 327, '<td valign="top">Amazing entry. 10 from me.</td>', 'Amazing entry. 10 from me.', '2009-03-09 21:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298287, 770486, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Really well done.9</td>', 'Lovely. Really well done.9', '2009-03-09 21:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298288, 771213, 96751, '<td valign="top">What a tale this tells.  Very strong lines drawing the eye to the center.  I''m probably the only one who feels that a dead center perspective may not be as strong as a slightly angled one might have been.  It''s also a tad overprocessed for my personal taste.  But that probably means you''ll do very well :-)</td>', 'What a tale this tells.  Very strong lines drawing the eye to the center.  I''m probably the only one who feels that a dead center perspective may not be as strong as a slightly angled one might have been.  It''s also a tad overprocessed for my personal taste.  But that probably means you''ll do very well :-)', '2009-03-09 21:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298291, 770942, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subjects.  I''m not wild about the angle, and it seems to be oversharpened.</td>', 'Very interesting subjects.  I''m not wild about the angle, and it seems to be oversharpened.', '2009-03-09 21:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298292, 771634, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed.  Just the right amount of contrast, but a tad over saturated on the door.</td>', 'Nicely executed.  Just the right amount of contrast, but a tad over saturated on the door.', '2009-03-09 21:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298293, 770897, 96751, '<td valign="top">I like how the dome draws the eye up, but I''m not wild about the PPing.</td>', 'I like how the dome draws the eye up, but I''m not wild about the PPing.', '2009-03-09 21:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298294, 771149, 96751, '<td valign="top">This looks like a screensaver!  Would have been a stronger image with something to focus the eye on.</td>', 'This looks like a screensaver!  Would have been a stronger image with something to focus the eye on.', '2009-03-09 21:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298295, 771229, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective on this, and the b/w.</td>', 'Love the perspective on this, and the b/w.', '2009-03-09 21:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298297, 770538, 96751, '<td valign="top">Looks like a charcoal drawing.</td>', 'Looks like a charcoal drawing.', '2009-03-09 21:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298300, 770869, 96751, '<td valign="top">How sad.  The wide angle really works on this.</td>', 'How sad.  The wide angle really works on this.', '2009-03-09 21:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298301, 771268, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very cool tools.  I''d have preferred less of them with a closer shot.  Also, a little light in the front for more detail.</td>', 'Very cool tools.  I''d have preferred less of them with a closer shot.  Also, a little light in the front for more detail.', '2009-03-09 21:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298303, 771589, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stunning car.  A bit too much yellow cast.</td>', 'Stunning car.  A bit too much yellow cast.', '2009-03-09 21:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298304, 770632, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  I like the contrasting shapes and the side lighting.  It does seem to be a bit out of focus.</td>', 'Lovely shot.  I like the contrasting shapes and the side lighting.  It does seem to be a bit out of focus.', '2009-03-09 21:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298306, 771541, 96751, '<td valign="top">We''ve come a long way...  Great camera, but background is really grainy.</td>', 'We''ve come a long way...  Great camera, but background is really grainy.', '2009-03-09 21:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298307, 771376, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great objects.  Composition is a bit weak.</td>', 'Great objects.  Composition is a bit weak.', '2009-03-09 21:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298309, 771346, 96751, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  Made me stop to figure it out.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  Made me stop to figure it out.', '2009-03-09 21:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298321, 771602, 34058, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful!  One of my top three favorites!</td>', 'Just beautiful!  One of my top three favorites!', '2009-03-09 21:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298323, 770854, 34058, '<td valign="top">This is amazing!  One of my top three favorites!</td>', 'This is amazing!  One of my top three favorites!', '2009-03-09 21:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298325, 771213, 34058, '<td valign="top">I absolutly love this photo!  One of my top three favorites!</td>', 'I absolutly love this photo!  One of my top three favorites!', '2009-03-09 21:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298326, 770486, 23317, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  My favorite of the challenge.  It was nice seeing something other than black and white.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  My favorite of the challenge.  It was nice seeing something other than black and white.', '2009-03-09 21:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298327, 770854, 23317, '<td valign="top">It was nice seeing something other than black and white.</td>', 'It was nice seeing something other than black and white.', '2009-03-09 21:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
