(5298330, 771502, 34058, '<td valign="top">I really like the coloring of this but I think the blanket in the forground takes away from this.  Either a tighter crop or remove the blanket.</td>', 'I really like the coloring of this but I think the blanket in the forground takes away from this.  Either a tighter crop or remove the blanket.', '2009-03-09 21:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
