(5298397, 769730, 327, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the relationship to the challenge with this image.  If I get DEEP I understand not so sure the masses will see it.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the relationship to the challenge with this image.  If I get DEEP I understand not so sure the masses will see it.', '2009-03-09 21:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
