(5298410, 771425, 327, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to say about this shot. I don''t find enough in focus to make a comment. It''s not overly interesting. Sorry. Hope you do okay in the challenge.</td>', 'Not sure what to say about this shot. I don''t find enough in focus to make a comment. It''s not overly interesting. Sorry. Hope you do okay in the challenge.', '2009-03-09 22:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
