(5298661, 771585, 96751, '<td valign="top">A lovely bridge.  I think the image overall lost some texture and detail in pp.</td>', 'A lovely bridge.  I think the image overall lost some texture and detail in pp.', '2009-03-10 02:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298662, 770486, 96751, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of HDR, but the composition and balance of this shot is nice.  The afternoon sun on the bridge is a bit too harsh and draws the eyes, unbalancing the shot.</td>', 'Not a fan of HDR, but the composition and balance of this shot is nice.  The afternoon sun on the bridge is a bit too harsh and draws the eyes, unbalancing the shot.', '2009-03-10 02:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298663, 771039, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love this shot for its simplicity and sepia tones (even the bird is great), but I feel that it really misses the mark.  The objects in the foreground are the dominant subject, and the hazy bridge in the distance, though a great counterbalance, is definitely secondary.</td>', 'I love this shot for its simplicity and sepia tones (even the bird is great), but I feel that it really misses the mark.  The objects in the foreground are the dominant subject, and the hazy bridge in the distance, though a great counterbalance, is definitely secondary.', '2009-03-10 02:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298664, 771296, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice kitchen objects, but the placement is a bit sterile.  I like the tones, but the shot is really grainy.  I think that works against the smoothness of the porcelain.</td>', 'Nice kitchen objects, but the placement is a bit sterile.  I like the tones, but the shot is really grainy.  I think that works against the smoothness of the porcelain.', '2009-03-10 02:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298665, 771625, 96751, '<td valign="top">Of the old doll shots, this is my favorite.  Lovely detail on the lace and face.  Love the side lighting, but it got away from you just a bit on the blouse.</td>', 'Of the old doll shots, this is my favorite.  Lovely detail on the lace and face.  Love the side lighting, but it got away from you just a bit on the blouse.', '2009-03-10 02:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298666, 770854, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I love the stars peeking through the rosy dawn (?), and the silhouetted tree.  Colors are rich too.</td>', 'Very nice.  I love the stars peeking through the rosy dawn (?), and the silhouetted tree.  Colors are rich too.', '2009-03-10 02:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298667, 770004, 96751, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand this shot.  The artistic furniture element is lovely, and I like the tilt, but the b/w rectangular portion inside the color portion is distracting and inexplicable.  I feel it severely detracts from an otherwise pretty shot.</td>', 'I don''t understand this shot.  The artistic furniture element is lovely, and I like the tilt, but the b/w rectangular portion inside the color portion is distracting and inexplicable.  I feel it severely detracts from an otherwise pretty shot.', '2009-03-10 02:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298668, 771459, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very photogenic windmill.</td>', 'Very photogenic windmill.', '2009-03-10 02:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298669, 771538, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shadow.  Very interesting and intriguing object.  The surface is a little buckled so it''s a little distracting, as are the creases at the curved edge.</td>', 'Wonderful shadow.  Very interesting and intriguing object.  The surface is a little buckled so it''s a little distracting, as are the creases at the curved edge.', '2009-03-10 02:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298670, 770993, 96751, '<td valign="top">This has the potential of being a very interesting shot.  There is just nowhere near enough light anywhere.</td>', 'This has the potential of being a very interesting shot.  There is just nowhere near enough light anywhere.', '2009-03-10 02:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298671, 770394, 96751, '<td valign="top">This shot really caught my attention.  I have mixed feelings about the wording on the rear wall, but it did make me stop to examine.</td>', 'This shot really caught my attention.  I have mixed feelings about the wording on the rear wall, but it did make me stop to examine.', '2009-03-10 02:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298672, 771163, 96751, '<td valign="top">The roof on this is incredible.  Great detail.  Love the tones, love how the trees balance out the structure.</td>', 'The roof on this is incredible.  Great detail.  Love the tones, love how the trees balance out the structure.', '2009-03-10 02:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298673, 771609, 96751, '<td valign="top">The almost feels as though it was in the hold of a ship.  Except I''m pretty sure ships didn''t have brick chimneys.... I like the content, but it''s missing some "pop".</td>', 'The almost feels as though it was in the hold of a ship.  Except I''m pretty sure ships didn''t have brick chimneys.... I like the content, but it''s missing some "pop".', '2009-03-10 02:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298674, 771252, 96751, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous night capture.  Great perspective and lucky moon adornment.</td>', 'Gorgeous night capture.  Great perspective and lucky moon adornment.', '2009-03-10 02:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298676, 771430, 96751, '<td valign="top">The b/w really adds to this shot.  The circular lines add interest to the rigid structure lines, and the straight line in the foreground draws the eye to the center with the pedestrian.  A little overlit in the second store facade.</td>', 'The b/w really adds to this shot.  The circular lines add interest to the rigid structure lines, and the straight line in the foreground draws the eye to the center with the pedestrian.  A little overlit in the second store facade.', '2009-03-10 02:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298677, 771457, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the objects independently.  Great detail, but, I don''t feel the composition is harmonious, and the vignetting impacts the doll''s "face".</td>', 'Love the objects independently.  Great detail, but, I don''t feel the composition is harmonious, and the vignetting impacts the doll''s "face".', '2009-03-10 02:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298678, 770300, 96751, '<td valign="top">A popular subject.  Almost from the same vantage point as the other.  I love the lit reflection in the water, and wonder why the lights are out in that dark area :-)</td>', 'A popular subject.  Almost from the same vantage point as the other.  I love the lit reflection in the water, and wonder why the lights are out in that dark area :-)', '2009-03-10 02:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
