(5298721, 771520, 99506, '<td valign="top">Yeah I reckon this one would say "I was made in the 1930s" lol.<br/> <br/>Interesting shot though</td>', 'Yeah I reckon this one would say "I was made in the 1930s" lol. Interesting shot though', '2009-03-10 04:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
