(5298742, 770642, 99506, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but the lack of focus makes it hard to look at</td>', 'Nice idea but the lack of focus makes it hard to look at', '2009-03-10 04:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298744, 771632, 99506, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but a bit more focus would have been good</td>', 'Nice idea but a bit more focus would have been good', '2009-03-10 04:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298745, 770992, 99506, '<td valign="top">Great moody shot, I really like this.</td>', 'Great moody shot, I really like this.', '2009-03-10 04:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298748, 770867, 99506, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and composition but it needs more focus and in my opinion it would be better if it were rotated so that the legs of the machine appear vertical in the shot.<br/> <br/>It would benefit from being bigger.</td>', 'Nice idea and composition but it needs more focus and in my opinion it would be better if it were rotated so that the legs of the machine appear vertical in the shot. It would benefit from being bigger.', '2009-03-10 05:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298754, 771320, 99506, '<td valign="top">Nice backlighting affect</td>', 'Nice backlighting affect', '2009-03-10 05:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298786, 771213, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a great scene, love the textures in the wood and the colours. You''re angle is a little obvious, it might be good to take this from low down next to those wooden floorboards.</td>', 'This is a great scene, love the textures in the wood and the colours. You''re angle is a little obvious, it might be good to take this from low down next to those wooden floorboards.', '2009-03-10 05:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298789, 771439, 101117, '<td valign="top">There''s too much in this shot. I can see that you are getting at the encyclopaedia, but then you have the lamp in the shot, which isn''t really helping. <br/> <br/>Also the layout you have chosen for the books might have been better. The part of the spine I can see in one looks really nice, perhaps try lining them all up as in a bookshelf with one lying open on the end, just a suggestion :)</td>', 'There''s too much in this shot. I can see that you are getting at the encyclopaedia, but then you have the lamp in the shot, which isn''t really helping.  Also the layout you have chosen for the books might have been better. The part of the spine I can see in one looks really nice, perhaps try lining them all up as in a bookshelf with one lying open on the end, just a suggestion :)', '2009-03-10 05:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298790, 771625, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice well lit portrait of the doll. I''m not completely sure about the black background but otherwise great shot.</td>', 'This is a very nice well lit portrait of the doll. I''m not completely sure about the black background but otherwise great shot.', '2009-03-10 05:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298792, 771502, 101117, '<td valign="top">The book itself certainly looks interesting but there''s a lot wrong with the shot.<br/> <br/>First and most obvious is what looks like a duvet or sheet in the lower left with what I think is a hand holding it. Next is the background, I''m guessing it''s a bed and I''m not sure what made you choose that, I think a desk or stone would have made a much better simpler background to keep emphasis on the book.<br/> <br/>Lastly is the way you have chosen to take the shot. For me most of the interest is in the front cover and I think this should have been your main focus, but you have left it at an angle partially covered up and made the focus the hand written text. I can see the need to include the date but I think you could have found a better way to present this.</td>', 'The book itself certainly looks interesting but there''s a lot wrong with the shot. First and most obvious is what looks like a duvet or sheet in the lower left with what I think is a hand holding it. Next is the background, I''m guessing it''s a bed and I''m not sure what made you choose that, I think a desk or stone would have made a much better simpler background to keep emphasis on the book. Lastly is the way you have chosen to take the shot. For me most of the interest is in the front cover and I think this should have been your main focus, but you have left it at an angle partially covered up and made the focus the hand written text. I can see the need to include the date but I think you could have found a better way to present this.', '2009-03-10 06:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298794, 770900, 101117, '<td valign="top">This shot has a lot of nice elements, which for the large part work well together.<br/> <br/>I think you may have over sharpened the shot, which is most apparent where the hill in the background meets the sky, there is a very defined edge. Also, there is a quite obvious halo around everything.<br/> <br/>Lastly, the colour in the sky, while being nice for a sunset or landscape shot, is a little overwhelming here and detracts from the main subject.</td>', 'This shot has a lot of nice elements, which for the large part work well together. I think you may have over sharpened the shot, which is most apparent where the hill in the background meets the sky, there is a very defined edge. Also, there is a quite obvious halo around everything. Lastly, the colour in the sky, while being nice for a sunset or landscape shot, is a little overwhelming here and detracts from the main subject.', '2009-03-10 06:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298798, 771566, 101117, '<td valign="top">You''ve done something a little strange with this shot, and my guess is messing with the curves to black out the background (or achieve some other effect) but it has resulted in a weird look to everything which doesn''t help at all.</td>', 'You''ve done something a little strange with this shot, and my guess is messing with the curves to black out the background (or achieve some other effect) but it has resulted in a weird look to everything which doesn''t help at all.', '2009-03-10 06:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298799, 771516, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple well lit shot. The tree doesn''t help but what can you do! I don''t know what is in the surrounding area but this might also have been nice if you had taken it in landscape format from further back with a lot of empty blue sky around it.</td>', 'Nice and simple well lit shot. The tree doesn''t help but what can you do! I don''t know what is in the surrounding area but this might also have been nice if you had taken it in landscape format from further back with a lot of empty blue sky around it.', '2009-03-10 06:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298800, 771557, 101117, '<td valign="top">There''s quite a lot of these in the challenge, but this is one of the better ones. I think the reflection has helped this one along a bit. I''m not sure about the lighting, it seems you have some direct front on light which has given the coin a very scratchy silvery look.<br/> <br/>I often find when I''m doing a shot of something like this it often ends up better when I use ambient or low lighting and go for longer exposure.</td>', 'There''s quite a lot of these in the challenge, but this is one of the better ones. I think the reflection has helped this one along a bit. I''m not sure about the lighting, it seems you have some direct front on light which has given the coin a very scratchy silvery look. I often find when I''m doing a shot of something like this it often ends up better when I use ambient or low lighting and go for longer exposure.', '2009-03-10 06:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298801, 771186, 101117, '<td valign="top">I can''t actually make out what this rock is all about. Is it part of the landscape or has it been placed there? Also, I don''t really see the relevance of the 1933 (water?) access port, unless of course the rock is part of the pavement and the two of them just happen to be together.</td>', 'I can''t actually make out what this rock is all about. Is it part of the landscape or has it been placed there? Also, I don''t really see the relevance of the 1933 (water?) access port, unless of course the rock is part of the pavement and the two of them just happen to be together.', '2009-03-10 06:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298802, 771182, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a nice well taken shot of this building. The sky is good but I think you somehow need some more drama to set this shot off. Perhaps a different time of the day.</td>', 'This is a nice well taken shot of this building. The sky is good but I think you somehow need some more drama to set this shot off. Perhaps a different time of the day.', '2009-03-10 06:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298804, 770637, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice enough shot, but doesn''t stand out particularly. It might be the angle you''ve taken it from, buildings like this often look better straight on to take in the whole thing.</td>', 'Nice enough shot, but doesn''t stand out particularly. It might be the angle you''ve taken it from, buildings like this often look better straight on to take in the whole thing.', '2009-03-10 06:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298806, 771392, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, but I''m going to mark it down a few points because to me it doesn''t meet challenge.<br/> <br/>On the shot itself the colours and landscape are nice but you have a very centred horizon. If you got lower down and moved the horizon to the lower third it might have worked better.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, but I''m going to mark it down a few points because to me it doesn''t meet challenge. On the shot itself the colours and landscape are nice but you have a very centred horizon. If you got lower down and moved the horizon to the lower third it might have worked better.', '2009-03-10 06:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298807, 771637, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting looking building, but I don''t think you''ve made the most of the shot. I realise you may be going for something different because you see it all the time, but from my point of view I''ve never seen it before and feel that you should have taken in the whole building.<br/> <br/>Also, I''m guessing that you''ve done some sort of dodging / burning here but you have ended up with halos around the building which don''t help the shot at all.</td>', 'This is an interesting looking building, but I don''t think you''ve made the most of the shot. I realise you may be going for something different because you see it all the time, but from my point of view I''ve never seen it before and feel that you should have taken in the whole building. Also, I''m guessing that you''ve done some sort of dodging / burning here but you have ended up with halos around the building which don''t help the shot at all.', '2009-03-10 06:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298809, 771429, 101117, '<td valign="top">It looks like you are simply documenting the rocks here as if to be archived somewhere. From that point of view you''ve done a fairly good job. You can see some good and interesting detail there, but the back half of the larger rock is starting to go out of focus, I think for this sort of shot you should have used a much longer DOF.</td>', 'It looks like you are simply documenting the rocks here as if to be archived somewhere. From that point of view you''ve done a fairly good job. You can see some good and interesting detail there, but the back half of the larger rock is starting to go out of focus, I think for this sort of shot you should have used a much longer DOF.', '2009-03-10 06:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298838, 771570, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice shot though I''m not sure about the trees in the foreground. I think this building would have stood well on it''s own. Sometimes I realise that it''s difficult to avoid things like this but I think in this case you could have easily avoided the branches from a different angle.</td>', 'Nice shot though I''m not sure about the trees in the foreground. I think this building would have stood well on it''s own. Sometimes I realise that it''s difficult to avoid things like this but I think in this case you could have easily avoided the branches from a different angle.', '2009-03-10 07:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298840, 771163, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting old building. I think the weather hasn''t helped you a whole lot here, the bland grey sky and the white snow have kind of made this image a little dull looking, I think it would be a lot better against either dramatic clouds or a strong blue, but what can you do, the elements don''t always play along!</td>', 'This is a very interesting old building. I think the weather hasn''t helped you a whole lot here, the bland grey sky and the white snow have kind of made this image a little dull looking, I think it would be a lot better against either dramatic clouds or a strong blue, but what can you do, the elements don''t always play along!', '2009-03-10 07:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298842, 771047, 101117, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the subject, I''m sure it meets challenge but I don''t know if it''s the best choice. I can see some interesting looking detail in the background which might have made a better shot.<br/> <br/>Also, I''m guessing you''re using on camera flash here which has caused a slightly unnatural colour in the foreground area and separated it from the background.<br/> <br/>I also don''t think you have made the best use of the location. I''m guessing this is some sort of old ruin, which are always really interesting pieces of architecture, but your choice of focus probably hasn''t emphasised that.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the subject, I''m sure it meets challenge but I don''t know if it''s the best choice. I can see some interesting looking detail in the background which might have made a better shot. Also, I''m guessing you''re using on camera flash here which has caused a slightly unnatural colour in the foreground area and separated it from the background. I also don''t think you have made the best use of the location. I''m guessing this is some sort of old ruin, which are always really interesting pieces of architecture, but your choice of focus probably hasn''t emphasised that.', '2009-03-10 07:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298848, 771296, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture, it has a good rustic old fashioned look. I''m guessing you added the grain here to give it an aged look, which I like, but you might suffer from it with some other voters.<br/> <br/>My only minor complaint is what I''m thinking is a cloth in the background of the photo (to the right) is a bit annoying, I think you should have possibly removed it for this shot.</td>', 'This is a nice picture, it has a good rustic old fashioned look. I''m guessing you added the grain here to give it an aged look, which I like, but you might suffer from it with some other voters. My only minor complaint is what I''m thinking is a cloth in the background of the photo (to the right) is a bit annoying, I think you should have possibly removed it for this shot.', '2009-03-10 07:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298855, 770869, 101117, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the shiny metallic fence and the old building behind it. I''m not usually a fan of fisheye shots, but I think it really works here as well. <br/> <br/>The textures in the door and the stone despite being behind the fence for the large part are still clear and sharp. Not sure if you did some PP to get those colours the way they are but if you did you made a good job of it.<br/> <br/>Great shot, after having gone through about a quarter of the entries, this is my favourite so far!</td>', 'I like the contrast of the shiny metallic fence and the old building behind it. I''m not usually a fan of fisheye shots, but I think it really works here as well.  The textures in the door and the stone despite being behind the fence for the large part are still clear and sharp. Not sure if you did some PP to get those colours the way they are but if you did you made a good job of it. Great shot, after having gone through about a quarter of the entries, this is my favourite so far!', '2009-03-10 07:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298856, 771300, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot, and I imagine it''s going to do pretty well and quite possibly ribbon.<br/> <br/>The whole thing has quite a glassy, frozen look about it, which is clever because there isn''t actually any ice in the shot. I think you''ve timed this exposure well, it''s not over the top smooth, but long enough to make it really interesting.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot, and I imagine it''s going to do pretty well and quite possibly ribbon. The whole thing has quite a glassy, frozen look about it, which is clever because there isn''t actually any ice in the shot. I think you''ve timed this exposure well, it''s not over the top smooth, but long enough to make it really interesting.', '2009-03-10 07:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298858, 771233, 101117, '<td valign="top">You only just managed to squeeze this one in then, what was the completion date? :)<br/> <br/>This is a good shot with nice colours. I''m not sure why you didn''t take it from the centre of the isle though, as that usually makes for a better composition in this sort of shot due to the symmetry.<br/> <br/>I imagine this will probably do quite well, it has a very DPC''ish feel about it.</td>', 'You only just managed to squeeze this one in then, what was the completion date? :) This is a good shot with nice colours. I''m not sure why you didn''t take it from the centre of the isle though, as that usually makes for a better composition in this sort of shot due to the symmetry. I imagine this will probably do quite well, it has a very DPC''ish feel about it.', '2009-03-10 07:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298859, 770684, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty nice shot, but there are a few things about it which are bothering me. <br/> <br/>First is the angle you have taken it from, though I realise that it''s probably built on a hill so I don''t know how much you could have done about that. <br/> <br/>Second is the sky, it''s pure white, a dramatic cloud cover would have worked better, though again, that''s probably not completely your fault, but most likely the wonderful depressing British weather. <br/> <br/>Lastly, and this is the only one that is strictly your fault, is the top of the lamp post sticking into the shot at the lower right is annoying, you could probably have got away with cloning that out under the advanced editing rules.</td>', 'This is a pretty nice shot, but there are a few things about it which are bothering me.  First is the angle you have taken it from, though I realise that it''s probably built on a hill so I don''t know how much you could have done about that.  Second is the sky, it''s pure white, a dramatic cloud cover would have worked better, though again, that''s probably not completely your fault, but most likely the wonderful depressing British weather.  Lastly, and this is the only one that is strictly your fault, is the top of the lamp post sticking into the shot at the lower right is annoying, you could probably have got away with cloning that out under the advanced editing rules.', '2009-03-10 07:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298861, 770916, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot, though the colours are a little strange. There appears to be a bit of an odd tint to the sky, especially to the lower left, but in general all over. There also seems to be just a tiny bit of motion blur going on, might want to try and up the shutter speed next time.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot, though the colours are a little strange. There appears to be a bit of an odd tint to the sky, especially to the lower left, but in general all over. There also seems to be just a tiny bit of motion blur going on, might want to try and up the shutter speed next time.', '2009-03-10 07:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298862, 771459, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a night straight forward shot with good composition. It''s a bit odd in that it has a general warm feeling overall yet there is snow lying on the ground. I think it''s probably because of the deep blue sky and the warm light on the windmill. I usually associate cold temperatures with a much paler blue sky.<br/> <br/>Despite that, which is just me being odd most likely, I really like this, it has a nice peaceful feel about it. I think it might have been better without the branches sticking in from the left, but not really much you could do to avoid that I''m guessing. 8.</td>', 'This is a night straight forward shot with good composition. It''s a bit odd in that it has a general warm feeling overall yet there is snow lying on the ground. I think it''s probably because of the deep blue sky and the warm light on the windmill. I usually associate cold temperatures with a much paler blue sky. Despite that, which is just me being odd most likely, I really like this, it has a nice peaceful feel about it. I think it might have been better without the branches sticking in from the left, but not really much you could do to avoid that I''m guessing. 8.', '2009-03-10 07:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298865, 770854, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot with nice colours. Especially like the stars in which I can see just a touch of movement which I''m guessing is from the long exposure.<br/> <br/>I would be very surprised if this didn''t finish in the top ten.</td>', 'This is a great shot with nice colours. Especially like the stars in which I can see just a touch of movement which I''m guessing is from the long exposure. I would be very surprised if this didn''t finish in the top ten.', '2009-03-10 07:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5298875, 770696, 104492, '<td valign="top">Love the way this photo was taken.  Very calming, warmth to it.  Great imagination.<br/> <br/>I GIVE IT A 10</td>', 'Love the way this photo was taken.  Very calming, warmth to it.  Great imagination. I GIVE IT A 10', '2009-03-10 08:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
