(5298909, 771163, 43774, '<td valign="top">A beautiful structure (is it a church)?  Well looked after and obviously restored, wood doesn''t last that long, does it? I like the darkness of the building against the snow. Those bare trees are nice and detailed too.</td>', 'A beautiful structure (is it a church)?  Well looked after and obviously restored, wood doesn''t last that long, does it? I like the darkness of the building against the snow. Those bare trees are nice and detailed too.', '2009-03-10 08:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
