(5298913, 770486, 43774, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of HDR because so often it is overdone. This is just on the edge for me, not quite overdone. I like that you included the bridge and that you managed to bring out the nice colours in it.<br/> <br/>Reminds me of my trip to London last September, I would love to go back.</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of HDR because so often it is overdone. This is just on the edge for me, not quite overdone. I like that you included the bridge and that you managed to bring out the nice colours in it. Reminds me of my trip to London last September, I would love to go back.', '2009-03-10 08:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
