(5298942, 769959, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a unique piece to photograph.  The detail in the lace is very good and I like the overall positioning of the doll.  From the lighting it seems like you were using natural window light?  A little bit of glare on the reflective surfaces...consider using a circular polarizer; it would allow you to knock down those reflections considerably.</td>', 'This is a unique piece to photograph.  The detail in the lace is very good and I like the overall positioning of the doll.  From the lighting it seems like you were using natural window light?  A little bit of glare on the reflective surfaces...consider using a circular polarizer; it would allow you to knock down those reflections considerably.', '2009-03-10 09:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
