(5299455, 770867, 30982, '<td valign="top">The picture is a bit small, though I can see where you maybe wanted it to look like a postage stamp.  There''s a very good tutorial <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here</a> that explains how to prepare the pictures for challenges so they can best be appreciated!</td>', 'The picture is a bit small, though I can see where you maybe wanted it to look like a postage stamp.  There''s a very good tutorial here that explains how to prepare the pictures for challenges so they can best be appreciated!', '2009-03-10 16:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5299520, 771452, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like this one for the forelorn and empty feel.  Almost can see ghosts here.</td>', 'I quite like this one for the forelorn and empty feel.  Almost can see ghosts here.', '2009-03-10 16:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5299522, 771556, 30982, '<td valign="top">Neat thing about this - even though the building appears to be rather significant in size, it is completely and utterly dwarfed by the range behind it.  Sort of a commentary on man''s significance in nature, in a way.</td>', 'Neat thing about this - even though the building appears to be rather significant in size, it is completely and utterly dwarfed by the range behind it.  Sort of a commentary on man''s significance in nature, in a way.', '2009-03-10 17:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5299524, 770185, 30982, '<td valign="top">Probably getting a few "doesn''t meet the challenge" assessments, and granted, probably doesn''t, but I quite like the shot anyway.</td>', 'Probably getting a few "doesn''t meet the challenge" assessments, and granted, probably doesn''t, but I quite like the shot anyway.', '2009-03-10 17:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5299525, 770897, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really quite a fun perspective!  Nice work with the processing to bring out the nifty colors, too.</td>', 'Really quite a fun perspective!  Nice work with the processing to bring out the nifty colors, too.', '2009-03-10 17:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5299527, 771466, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite like how this is so dark and moody to match the environment.</td>', 'Quite like how this is so dark and moody to match the environment.', '2009-03-10 17:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5299528, 770394, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite an interesting shot, especially trying to figure what''s going on on the wall behind.</td>', 'Quite an interesting shot, especially trying to figure what''s going on on the wall behind.', '2009-03-10 17:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5299535, 771392, 56502, '<td valign="top">Well, let''s say in your favor that the mountains in the back are older than 100 years. In any event a nice shot.</td>', 'Well, let''s say in your favor that the mountains in the back are older than 100 years. In any event a nice shot.', '2009-03-10 17:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5299537, 771149, 102362, '<td valign="top">false. millions of years? hmm</td>', 'false. millions of years? hmm', '2009-03-10 17:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5299554, 771300, 14867, '<td valign="top">Powerful, perhaps a bit overprocessed but still nice. 7.</td>', 'Powerful, perhaps a bit overprocessed but still nice. 7.', '2009-03-10 17:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5299556, 770004, 14867, '<td valign="top">Nice detail, the oblique framing is excellent, I think I would prefer it without the desaturated area</td>', 'Nice detail, the oblique framing is excellent, I think I would prefer it without the desaturated area', '2009-03-10 17:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5299572, 771601, 14867, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the use of colors here and, more important, this harsh contrast between vivid colors is working against the idea of "100 years Old"</td>', 'Not sure I like the use of colors here and, more important, this harsh contrast between vivid colors is working against the idea of "100 years Old"', '2009-03-10 17:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5299588, 771182, 22538, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but  could have been better without the distraction of modern builidings on the right.</td>', 'Nice shot but  could have been better without the distraction of modern builidings on the right.', '2009-03-10 17:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5299606, 769801, 22459, '<td valign="top">not sure about the frame?</td>', 'not sure about the frame?', '2009-03-10 18:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5299609, 770185, 22459, '<td valign="top">great take on the challenge,unfortunatley I''m sure not everyone will see it that way. Besides what people think about the challenge issue this is a really well shot image.</td>', 'great take on the challenge,unfortunatley I''m sure not everyone will see it that way. Besides what people think about the challenge issue this is a really well shot image.', '2009-03-10 18:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5299634, 771583, 102315, '<td valign="top">I like this one. My first ten in this challenge. I grainy look makes you feel that this photo is old.</td>', 'I like this one. My first ten in this challenge. I grainy look makes you feel that this photo is old.', '2009-03-10 18:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5299637, 771625, 102315, '<td valign="top">That''s doll is kinda creepy looking.</td>', 'That''s doll is kinda creepy looking.', '2009-03-10 18:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
