(5299874, 770556, 102315, '<td valign="top">I really like the sharpness of the canon and the blurred effect everywhere else. Makes this photo pop out to the eye more.</td>', 'I really like the sharpness of the canon and the blurred effect everywhere else. Makes this photo pop out to the eye more.', '2009-03-10 21:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
