(5316623, 771051, 31637, '<td valign="top">This is a beautifully lit portrait, looking like a scene from a motion picture film, making for a great image. It''s a bit cluttered yes, not that bad to distract from the model since the dominating window compliments her, and she is wearing very old clothes, but not sure whether any other of your subjects are 100 years old here including the curtains, chair. etc.<br/> <br/>Bumped to an 8, good luck.</td>', 'This is a beautifully lit portrait, looking like a scene from a motion picture film, making for a great image. It''s a bit cluttered yes, not that bad to distract from the model since the dominating window compliments her, and she is wearing very old clothes, but not sure whether any other of your subjects are 100 years old here including the curtains, chair. etc. Bumped to an 8, good luck.', '2009-03-11 23:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
