(5329378, 771039, 74534, '<td valign="top">I am jealous. I live in this city and not in a 100 years (forgive the pun) could have come up with this shot. Everything works perfectly: foreground, background, bird, sepia toning. Maybe the composition is a bit heavy on the right side, but that''s just nitpicking.<br/> <br/>And most importantly I love the overall feeling of the shot. 10 from me and my pick for yellow ribbon.</td>', 'I am jealous. I live in this city and not in a 100 years (forgive the pun) could have come up with this shot. Everything works perfectly: foreground, background, bird, sepia toning. Maybe the composition is a bit heavy on the right side, but that''s just nitpicking. And most importantly I love the overall feeling of the shot. 10 from me and my pick for yellow ribbon.', '2009-03-12 22:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329383, 771185, 23317, '<td valign="top">Interesting tree.  The darkness in the corners distracts me a bit</td>', 'Interesting tree.  The darkness in the corners distracts me a bit', '2009-03-12 22:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
