(5329395, 771189, 23317, '<td valign="top">Just doesn''t draw me in to any one item.</td>', 'Just doesn''t draw me in to any one item.', '2009-03-12 22:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329399, 771172, 74534, '<td valign="top">Yes, your juxtaposition works wonders in this image. The composition, though very center-heavy, is great for your message as is leads the eye where all the people are converging, to the symbol of old, majesty and power. Well done.<br/> <br/>I normally prefer a bit more natural toning (did you put in a touch of HDR there?) but I like how your tones add punch to an already powerful image. 10 from me.</td>', 'Yes, your juxtaposition works wonders in this image. The composition, though very center-heavy, is great for your message as is leads the eye where all the people are converging, to the symbol of old, majesty and power. Well done. I normally prefer a bit more natural toning (did you put in a touch of HDR there?) but I like how your tones add punch to an already powerful image. 10 from me.', '2009-03-12 22:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329401, 771436, 23317, '<td valign="top">Nice lines.  The lighting just doesn''t seem ideal.</td>', 'Nice lines.  The lighting just doesn''t seem ideal.', '2009-03-12 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329404, 771556, 23317, '<td valign="top">Nice background.</td>', 'Nice background.', '2009-03-12 22:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329409, 771529, 23317, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast.</td>', 'Nice contrast.', '2009-03-12 22:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329410, 771229, 74534, '<td valign="top">In my own shots I often struggle for this "heart of the street" intangible, and rarely achieve it. You have done it here. I guess you had to go really close to the asphalt to find the heart of the street though :) I have never been able to make this viewpoint work for me, but you have used beautifully here.<br/> <br/>I like the B&amp;W treatment as well, and the richness of the image. I am slightly doubtful about how well it meets the challenge, but still a 10 from me and my pick for yellow ribbon.</td>', 'In my own shots I often struggle for this "heart of the street" intangible, and rarely achieve it. You have done it here. I guess you had to go really close to the asphalt to find the heart of the street though :) I have never been able to make this viewpoint work for me, but you have used beautifully here. I like the B&W treatment as well, and the richness of the image. I am slightly doubtful about how well it meets the challenge, but still a 10 from me and my pick for yellow ribbon.', '2009-03-12 22:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329411, 771645, 23317, '<td valign="top">Nothing drew me in.</td>', 'Nothing drew me in.', '2009-03-12 22:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329417, 771624, 23317, '<td valign="top">I actually thought everyone would go with this type of effect... surprised to see so few of them.</td>', 'I actually thought everyone would go with this type of effect... surprised to see so few of them.', '2009-03-12 22:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329419, 771397, 23317, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.', '2009-03-12 22:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329421, 771593, 74534, '<td valign="top">Yes, you have indeed captured the feel of this place, at least for me. The combination of beautiful colors in the buildings and the white in the snow work very well. The composition is strong as well, with a nice foreground element that adds interest and good leading lines into the background.</td>', 'Yes, you have indeed captured the feel of this place, at least for me. The combination of beautiful colors in the buildings and the white in the snow work very well. The composition is strong as well, with a nice foreground element that adds interest and good leading lines into the background.', '2009-03-12 22:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329429, 771650, 23317, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection.</td>', 'Nice reflection.', '2009-03-12 22:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329434, 771163, 74534, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge, I really like the composition. Well balanced, leads the eye up and down around your subject and, above all, simple and powerful.</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge, I really like the composition. Well balanced, leads the eye up and down around your subject and, above all, simple and powerful.', '2009-03-12 22:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329437, 771651, 23317, '<td valign="top">White background maybe.  The black just didn''t provide the contrast for me.</td>', 'White background maybe.  The black just didn''t provide the contrast for me.', '2009-03-12 22:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329440, 771637, 23317, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and sky.</td>', 'Nice perspective and sky.', '2009-03-12 22:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329446, 771234, 23317, '<td valign="top">Nice simplicity</td>', 'Nice simplicity', '2009-03-12 22:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329448, 771582, 23317, '<td valign="top">Just too many graves.</td>', 'Just too many graves.', '2009-03-12 22:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329449, 771355, 74534, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you''re headed for a 4.x so I have to leave a comment - I think this is a great shot. I like the juxtaposition of old and new, the muted (but not completely desaturated!) colors in the back and the bright reds on the jeans. Your image is definitely about old and new at the same time, congrats on having the courage to draw attention to the new by both color and title even though the challenge is about the old!</td>', 'I''m guessing you''re headed for a 4.x so I have to leave a comment - I think this is a great shot. I like the juxtaposition of old and new, the muted (but not completely desaturated!) colors in the back and the bright reds on the jeans. Your image is definitely about old and new at the same time, congrats on having the courage to draw attention to the new by both color and title even though the challenge is about the old!', '2009-03-12 22:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329452, 771233, 23317, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors</td>', 'Beautiful colors', '2009-03-12 22:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329461, 771583, 74534, '<td valign="top">The intangible quality of light in this image is fantastic, and really makes the shot. I like your B&amp;W treatment as well, the nicely muted contrast and the warm melancholy that it produces.</td>', 'The intangible quality of light in this image is fantastic, and really makes the shot. I like your B&W treatment as well, the nicely muted contrast and the warm melancholy that it produces.', '2009-03-12 22:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329463, 771323, 23317, '<td valign="top">Fantastic sky.  The bubble effect messes with my perspective a bit.</td>', 'Fantastic sky.  The bubble effect messes with my perspective a bit.', '2009-03-12 22:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329474, 771308, 23317, '<td valign="top">Nothing draws me in.</td>', 'Nothing draws me in.', '2009-03-12 22:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329489, 771347, 74534, '<td valign="top">There''s something in this image that keeps drawing me back, for some reason I can''t really identify it''s just so aesthetically pleasing. I like the textures and the many levels of focus all the way to the nice bokeh with just the right amount of highlights.</td>', 'There''s something in this image that keeps drawing me back, for some reason I can''t really identify it''s just so aesthetically pleasing. I like the textures and the many levels of focus all the way to the nice bokeh with just the right amount of highlights.', '2009-03-12 22:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329493, 770632, 23317, '<td valign="top">Wanted to see a little more of the wagon</td>', 'Wanted to see a little more of the wagon', '2009-03-12 22:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329500, 771483, 23317, '<td valign="top">Too many gravestones, but nice perspective</td>', 'Too many gravestones, but nice perspective', '2009-03-12 22:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329509, 771123, 23317, '<td valign="top">For a good time, call 555-4367</td>', 'For a good time, call 555-4367', '2009-03-12 22:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329520, 771457, 23317, '<td valign="top">Her face is missing!  It bothers me for some reason.</td>', 'Her face is missing!  It bothers me for some reason.', '2009-03-12 22:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329528, 771625, 23317, '<td valign="top">She almost looks real</td>', 'She almost looks real', '2009-03-12 22:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
