(5331378, 770911, 85866, '<td valign="top">This immediately catches the eye ... the design is so complex yet pleasing.<br/>Deserves to win ... in my opinion.</td>', 'This immediately catches the eye ... the design is so complex yet pleasing.Deserves to win ... in my opinion.', '2009-03-13 02:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
