(5366927, 771596, 39880, '<td valign="top">This looks good.  I like the lighting on it and detail on the coin.  Nice work.</td>', 'This looks good.  I like the lighting on it and detail on the coin.  Nice work.', '2009-03-15 18:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
