(5370164, 771392, 83313, '<td valign="top">Really surprised me that this came in sub-5. I gave it an 8. I think I know what the problem was, however. When I was voting on this, my wife came into the room and mentioned how wonderful this shot was, and asked who did it. My wife liking your entry is the kiss of mediocrity. Sorry.</td>', 'Really surprised me that this came in sub-5. I gave it an 8. I think I know what the problem was, however. When I was voting on this, my wife came into the room and mentioned how wonderful this shot was, and asked who did it. My wife liking your entry is the kiss of mediocrity. Sorry.', '2009-03-16 00:22:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5370210, 771320, 98771, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle of your shot, I''m guessing it was shot later in the day. I''ve only been there at sunrise, good job neighbor.</td>', 'I really like the angle of your shot, I''m guessing it was shot later in the day. I''ve only been there at sunrise, good job neighbor.', '2009-03-16 00:28:23.000000', NULL, 0),
