(5370371, 771583, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rodfulk:</b></div><hr/><i> A little to much light torough the window causing a unwanted glare. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That unwanted glare is what makes the shot better, IMO. Without it you''d lose a lot of the feeling and the sense of days gone by.</td>', 'Originally posted by rodfulk: A little to much light torough the window causing a unwanted glare.   That unwanted glare is what makes the shot better, IMO. Without it you''d lose a lot of the feeling and the sense of days gone by.', '2009-03-16 00:49:09.000000', NULL, 0),
