(5370579, 771430, 62357, '<td valign="top">Figured this one was yours Deb!  Getting good at guessing now.  Probably it was the German look that gave it away this time :)  Nice score, well done.</td>', 'Figured this one was yours Deb!  Getting good at guessing now.  Probably it was the German look that gave it away this time :)  Nice score, well done.', '2009-03-16 01:26:40.000000', NULL, 0),
