(5370649, 771624, 97166, '<td valign="top">My only 9.  You tricked me about the overlay! (or lack thereof). <br/> <br/>Truly, you were mightily robbed here.<br/> <br/>I''m also almost shocked that this didn''t get a Posthumous ribbon, considering his glowing comment. lol.<br/> <br/>*edit* Also, for the record, I didn''t submit a DQ request, AND I didn''t see any kind of validation stamp of any kind when I commented.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-16 01:38:42.</i></td>', 'My only 9.  You tricked me about the overlay! (or lack thereof).  Truly, you were mightily robbed here. I''m also almost shocked that this didn''t get a Posthumous ribbon, considering his glowing comment. lol. *edit* Also, for the record, I didn''t submit a DQ request, AND I didn''t see any kind of validation stamp of any kind when I commented.', '2009-03-16 01:36:06.000000', '2009-03-16 01:38:42.000000', 0),
(5370661, 771229, 66515, '<td valign="top">I am guessing that the only reason that this didn''t do better was because of the challenge and not because of the image itself. I personally think its a unique take on the challenge and you''ve captured it well.</td>', 'I am guessing that the only reason that this didn''t do better was because of the challenge and not because of the image itself. I personally think its a unique take on the challenge and you''ve captured it well.', '2009-03-16 01:39:33.000000', NULL, 0),
