(5370688, 771149, 62357, '<td valign="top">Really sorry this didn''t score higher for you.  It deserved to.</td>', 'Really sorry this didn''t score higher for you.  It deserved to.', '2009-03-16 01:44:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5370691, 771616, 62357, '<td valign="top">Expected this to score a bit higher.  Nicely done</td>', 'Expected this to score a bit higher.  Nicely done', '2009-03-16 01:44:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5370702, 771399, 52549, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, love the title too. Huge congrats on your first ribbon, Goran. I wish you many more!</td>', 'Beautiful image, love the title too. Huge congrats on your first ribbon, Goran. I wish you many more!', '2009-03-16 01:47:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5370712, 770486, 52549, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful image, love the colors. Congratulations on the red, Jim.</td>', 'Really beautiful image, love the colors. Congratulations on the red, Jim.', '2009-03-16 01:48:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5370720, 770638, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great angle for this building, and a gorgeous building.  Maybe a tad oversaturated but that''s a matter of personal taste - if you like it, it''s good.  The one hazard to HDR I haven''t figured a way to fix yet is the tendency for it to add a lot of reds.  Since you started with a red building, it did crank those up a bit.  The range is good, though - brings out the textures and detail very well.</td>', 'Great angle for this building, and a gorgeous building.  Maybe a tad oversaturated but that''s a matter of personal taste - if you like it, it''s good.  The one hazard to HDR I haven''t figured a way to fix yet is the tendency for it to add a lot of reds.  Since you started with a red building, it did crank those up a bit.  The range is good, though - brings out the textures and detail very well.', '2009-03-16 01:50:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5370744, 770854, 52549, '<td valign="top">Glad this did well for you, it''s a beautiful scene. Magical, really. Big congrats on your ribbon.</td>', 'Glad this did well for you, it''s a beautiful scene. Magical, really. Big congrats on your ribbon.', '2009-03-16 01:54:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5370745, 771399, 59267, '<td valign="top">BINGO! this win a blue as I predicted! Congratulations on your PB and blue ribbon! Excellent and awesome photo. added to my FAV.</td>', 'BINGO! this win a blue as I predicted! Congratulations on your PB and blue ribbon! Excellent and awesome photo. added to my FAV.', '2009-03-16 01:54:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5370761, 770486, 59267, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and tone. Congratulations on your ribbon!!</td>', 'Great lighting and tone. Congratulations on your ribbon!!', '2009-03-16 01:56:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5370773, 770854, 59267, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!! beautiful shot.</td>', 'Congratulations!! beautiful shot.', '2009-03-16 01:58:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5370811, 771185, 52472, '<td valign="top">For the people who have doubts about the age of this tree: the location is at nearly 6000 feet, so one would expect a slow growth and it made an old impression on me. How it is possible to guess the trunk diameter without a reference is beyond me, it was certainly more than 14 inches!</td>', 'For the people who have doubts about the age of this tree: the location is at nearly 6000 feet, so one would expect a slow growth and it made an old impression on me. How it is possible to guess the trunk diameter without a reference is beyond me, it was certainly more than 14 inches!', '2009-03-16 02:09:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5370951, 771596, 28742, '<td valign="top">Hey congrats on top 10, Jeff! One of my top picks.</td>', 'Hey congrats on top 10, Jeff! One of my top picks.', '2009-03-16 02:39:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5370986, 771624, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Rachel:</b></div><hr/><i>NOT an overlay. Shot through the the viewfinder { TtV} of a vintage Kodak Duaflex 2 620 film cam with my macro lens. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>BRILLIANT! This was one of my fav''s. The technique was (like I said), brilliant, but a more lively or interesting subject might have pushed this way up. Congrats though, on an outstanding and creative (and legal) job! :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Rachel:NOT an overlay. Shot through the the viewfinder { TtV} of a vintage Kodak Duaflex 2 620 film cam with my macro lens.  BRILLIANT! This was one of my fav''s. The technique was (like I said), brilliant, but a more lively or interesting subject might have pushed this way up. Congrats though, on an outstanding and creative (and legal) job! :)', '2009-03-16 02:45:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5371170, 771122, 62357, '<td valign="top">Tiberius, I may not be the best person to comment on your image, because actually I gave this a highish score (7).  I think possibly the one comment you did get is helpful from a technical point of view.  You could have cropped it a bit differently to exclude the foreground.  As you said in the forum post,I think most people probably did not recognise it as Tian''an Men Square and as you say, focused on the picture of Mao, thus not finding the connection to 100 years old very easily.<br/> <br/>I personally thought it was an interesting take on the challenge and am sorry and surprised it did not do better for you.</td>', 'Tiberius, I may not be the best person to comment on your image, because actually I gave this a highish score (7).  I think possibly the one comment you did get is helpful from a technical point of view.  You could have cropped it a bit differently to exclude the foreground.  As you said in the forum post,I think most people probably did not recognise it as Tian''an Men Square and as you say, focused on the picture of Mao, thus not finding the connection to 100 years old very easily. I personally thought it was an interesting take on the challenge and am sorry and surprised it did not do better for you.', '2009-03-16 03:19:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5371539, 770486, 36606, '<td valign="top">hey man congrats on the ribbon</td>', 'hey man congrats on the ribbon', '2009-03-16 03:57:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5371750, 770486, 3746, '<td valign="top">Great shot - nice to see this scene from a slightly different angle, I''ll probably get myself down there now and completely rip this idea off - much like all my other stuff!!</td>', 'Great shot - nice to see this scene from a slightly different angle, I''ll probably get myself down there now and completely rip this idea off - much like all my other stuff!!', '2009-03-16 04:07:46.000000', NULL, 0);
