(5372613, 771516, 103601, '<td valign="top">thanks for all the comments! i was happy this pic came out even this good. the skies were really gray that day and i was in a hurry. also, they were doing beach replenishment right by the lighthouse, so i couldn''t get over the dunes to take a pic and there were a bunch of ugly trucks all over the place</td>', 'thanks for all the comments! i was happy this pic came out even this good. the skies were really gray that day and i was in a hurry. also, they were doing beach replenishment right by the lighthouse, so i couldn''t get over the dunes to take a pic and there were a bunch of ugly trucks all over the place', '2009-03-16 08:20:11.000000', NULL, 0),
