(5501103, 771545, 69008, '<td valign="top">This deserved a much better score. It''s not easy to get a big score in any "Advanced Editing" challenge, even with a tack sharp shot. Thumbs up to you for entering a shot that is different from the "DPC norm" for this sort of challenge.  I like it.</td>', 'This deserved a much better score. It''s not easy to get a big score in any "Advanced Editing" challenge, even with a tack sharp shot. Thumbs up to you for entering a shot that is different from the "DPC norm" for this sort of challenge.  I like it.', '2009-05-27 00:43:27.000000', NULL, 0),
